      "label": "The edit box's shape menu is the browser's own <select>, and the formatted view edits with the browser's editing commands",
      "excerpt": "The edit box's shape menu is the browser's own <select>, and the formatted view edits with the browser's editing commands",
      "text": "Can we get clever and use our own dropdown?  It'll be jarring if that one place in the UI a dropdown looks different.",
